{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c01b3df0-6bb0-49d7-ac44-6493d161b71d",
    "name": "Prasetiya Mulya - Payment Integration (PRASMUL)",
    "description": "Collection API pembayaran Xendit Maleo khusus Universitas Prasetiya Mulya (PRASMUL).\n\nAlur penggunaan:\n1. Login untuk mendapatkan Token autentikasi.\n2. Buat tagihan Virtual Account atau QRIS dengan menyertakan order_id dari sistem Prasmul.\n3. Cek status pembayaran atau terima notifikasi callback saat pembayaran lunas.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "8637073"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Login PRASMUL",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jsonData.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token PRASMUL tersimpan:', jsonData.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"partner.prasmul@digitalcity.id\",\n    \"password\": \"Prasmul123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/partners/login/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "partners",
                "login",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Login akun partner Prasetiya Mulya. Token otomatis disimpan ke variabel {{token}}."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Orders",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 Create Order - Virtual Account (BANK)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.order_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('order_id', jsonData.data.order_id);",
                  "    console.log('Order ID tersimpan:', jsonData.data.order_id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Token {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"order_id\": \"PRASMUL-202611-001\",\n    \"basic_price\": 5000000,\n    \"payment_method\": \"BANK\",\n    \"bank_code\": \"BCA\",\n    \"description\": \"Pembayaran Biaya Kuliah Semester Ganjil\",\n    \"callback_url\": \"https://prasmul.ac.id/api/payment/callback\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/partners/orders/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "partners",
                "orders",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Membuat Virtual Account Xendit untuk Prasmul. Partner mengirimkan basic_price (HPP tagihan murni). Backend otomatis menghitung admin_fee (9.000), ppn_admin_fee (990), processing_fee (4.000), ppn_processing_fee (400), platform_fee (1.500) dan menjumlahkannya ke 'amount' yang harus dibayar customer. Pilihan bank_code: BCA, BNI, BRI, MANDIRI, PERMATA, BSI, BJB."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 Create Order - QRIS",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.order_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('order_id', jsonData.data.order_id);",
                  "    console.log('Order ID tersimpan:', jsonData.data.order_id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Token {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"order_id\": \"prasmul-202611-002\",\n    \"basic_price\": 350000,\n    \"payment_method\": \"QRIS\",\n    \"description\": \"Biaya Pendaftaran Mahasiswa Baru\",\n    \"callback_url\": \"https://prasmul.ac.id/api/payment/callback\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/partners/orders/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "partners",
                "orders",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Membuat pembayaran QRIS Dinamis Xendit. Partner mengirimkan basic_price (HPP tagihan). Backend otomatis menghitung admin_fee (0.7% x basic_price), ppn_admin_fee (11% x admin_fee), processing_fee (4.000), ppn_processing_fee (400), platform_fee (1.500) dan menjumlahkannya ke 'amount' yang di-generate ke QR code."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2.3 List Orders PRASMUL",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Token {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/partners/orders/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "partners",
                "orders",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Menampilkan seluruh riwayat order milik Prasetiya Mulya."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2.4 Detail Order by Order ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Token {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/partners/order/detail/{{order_id}}/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "partners",
                "order",
                "detail",
                "{{order_id}}",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Melihat status dan detail order. Bisa menggunakan order_id sistem Prasmul ('SPP-202611-001') atau order_id lengkap dengan prefix ('PRASMUL-SPP-202611-001')."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
